{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VpyH33xWvs83B1ST6TMGwc","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# Objects and materials as data\n9:## Use one\n34:## The core library\n46:## Materials on surfaces\n63:| Pattern | Numbers | What |\n64:| --- | --- | --- |\n65:| none | | the light alone |\n66:| planks | bw 3, len 14, dir | boards with joints; staves on round parts; dir: 'v' turns them |\n67:| crate | frame 2, bw 3 | a framed, braced side; planks on its lid |\n68:| bricks | bw 6, bh 3, mortar | running bond |\n69:| stones | size 5 | irregular stones (Voronoi), dark joints, a lit rim |\n70:| tiles | size 4 | square tiles, grout |\n71:| speck, noise | amount .08; scale 4 | specks; soft patches |\n72:| foliage | size 3.5 | leaf clumps lit on top |\n73:| bark | | fissures; rings on a cut end |\n74:| metal | rivet | a shine where lit; rivets |\n75:| cloth | fold .9 | weave and folds |\n76:| glaze | | a glossy shine |\n77:| thatch, shingles | course; bw | straw courses; roof tiles |\n84:## Write one\n99:| Part | Form | Notes |\n100:| --- | --- | --- |\n101:| box | `['box', m, at, [w, d, h], { rot }]` | at: the bottom middle |\n102:| cyl | `['cyl', m, at, r, h, { r2, seg, sq }]` | r2: top radius (0: a cone); sq squashes y; seg: 6 for a hexagon |\n103:| lathe | `['lathe', m, at, [[r, z], ...], { seg }]` | a profile turned about z, bottom to top; [0, z] closes an end |\n104:| ball | `['ball', m, at, r, { sz }]` | at: its centre; sz below 1 flattens it |\n105:| prism | `['prism', m, at, [[a, b], ...], h, { axis }]` | an outline pushed h: up z (outline x, y), or centred along y (outline x, z) or x (outline y, z) |\n106:| wedge | `['wedge', m, at, [w, d, h]]` | h tall at the back, down to the floor at the front |\n107:| rock | `['rock', m, at, r, { sz, seed, rough }]` | a lumpy, faceted ball; below the floor is not drawn |\n108:| use | `['use', id, at, { rot, scale, mats, ...params }]` | another shape inside this one |\n109:| mirror | `['mirror', 'x' \\| 'y' \\| 'xy', part]` | the part and its mirror copies |\n110:| ring, row | `['ring', n, radius, part]`, `['row', n, [dx, dy, dz], part]` | n copies round z (the part moved out to radius); n copies in a line, centred |\n111:| group | `['group', at, rot, [parts]]` | parts moved and turned together |\n116:### Worked entries\n135:## Make one: the recipe\n155:## Limits\nkenney-tiny-battle:tile-0006       sprite    166 tok  grey rounded car, white windshield glint, small wheels  [vehicle prop battle]\nkenney-tiny-battle:tile-0024       sprite    161 tok  grey rounded car, narrow glint, variant  [vehicle prop battle]\ncart                               shape     105 tok  hand cart, two wheels, shafts forward  [vehicle farm]\nkaykit-halloween-bits:pumpkin-yellow-jackolantern shape     527 tok  golden yellow pumpkin, faint carved face, short stem  [decoration pumpkin halloween]\nkaykit-restaurant-bits:crate-carrots shape     472 tok  low wooden crate with carrots on top  [container crate kitchen market]\nkaykit-restaurant-bits:food-dinner shape     526 tok  roast meat, potatoes and carrots on a white plate  [food meal restaurant tavern]\nkaykit-restaurant-bits:kitchentable-a-large-decorated shape     724 tok  grey steel prep table piled with carrots, bread, bowls  [furniture table kitchen]\nkenney-fantasy-town:cart           shape     179 tok  wooden hand cart, plank bed, grey wheels  [vehicle town farm market]\nkenney-food:carton                 shape     159 tok  milk carton, white with purple stripes  [drink carton kitchen shop]\nkenney-food:carton-small           shape     135 tok  small milk carton, white with pink label  [drink carton kitchen shop]\nkenney-food:fries                  shape     673 tok  red carton of golden fries  [food diner fastfood]\nkenney-graveyard:gravestone-cross  shape     287 tok  rounded grey headstone with a carved cross, slab base  [grave graveyard]\nkenney-graveyard:pumpkin-carved    shape     227 tok  carved jack-o'-lantern, glowin